      "title": "The Study Grove",
      "speaker": "Old Oak",
      "text": "Long ago, the Grove hid its magic inside riddles.\n\nSage Pip knows numbers. Librarian Wren knows the world. Answer their questions \u2014 8 right answers will open the golden gate.\n\nThere are no monsters here. Take your time, and ask for a hint whenever you need one."
